# Force LF line endings for shell scripts so the shebang works on macOS/Linux.
# ClawHub/SkillHub publish the working tree directly; with core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows, a plain checkout would reconvert .sh to CRLF and break the shebang
# (#!/bin/bash^M -> "bad interpreter") on POSIX systems. eol=lf overrides that.
*.sh eol=lf
# Keep this file itself LF as well (harmless either way, but tidy).
*.gitattributes eol=lf
